  "support" half of the §7.4 "party/support build" case): the support's stats must
  fold into the active skill's output, so it diverges from the bare single-spell
  fixture in a way only the support pipeline produces.

  Provenance (humanGate=gamedata): authored from upstream save formats. NO live
  scraping, NO bundled GGG assets. gamedata IDs used:
    - class: Sorceress  (PoB2 spec classId/classInternalId = 7)
    - item base: Attuned Wand  (Bases/wand.lua, type "Wand")
    - active gem: Metadata/Items/Gems/SkillGemArc  (Arc) -> skill ArcPlayer
    - support gem: Metadata/Items/Gems/SupportGemElementalFocus (Elemental Focus)
                   -> skill SupportElementalFocusPlayer
-->
